WEBVTT

01:41.080 --> 01:42.640
Fine, let's stick to the plan.

01:43.200 --> 01:44.680
Thank you for your effort.

01:47.480 --> 01:48.920
Good thing I didn't listen to you.

01:49.560 --> 01:50.720
I had a deal with my ex.

01:50.800 --> 01:52.400
The price is high,

01:52.480 --> 01:55.280
but it's totally worth it.

01:55.360 --> 01:57.280
Then I'll go to Gao Ge Gym again.

03:01.400 --> 03:03.240
Hello. I'm Su Miao.

03:07.000 --> 03:07.840
Hello.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.400
Ms. Su.

03:17.160 --> 03:20.120
We'd love to invite you to be the model
for Starlight Eyeshadow.

03:21.160 --> 03:23.240
Our product suits all kinds of skin.

03:23.320 --> 03:24.960
It's tender, smooth, and smudge-proof.

03:25.040 --> 03:27.800
We have many colors, and you can mix them.

03:27.880 --> 03:30.160
It can help every woman
to get their ideal makeup.

03:31.080 --> 03:33.600
Starlight Eyeshadow
is independently developed by us

03:33.680 --> 03:36.720
with an affordable price
and internationally recognized quality.

03:36.800 --> 03:37.920
Our mission

03:38.000 --> 03:41.800
is to make every ordinary woman
beautiful and confident.

03:58.720 --> 03:59.560
It's pretty good.

04:04.960 --> 04:06.120
Can the eyeshadow

04:06.760 --> 04:09.280
really make an ordinary woman
beautiful and confident?

04:11.680 --> 04:13.840
Do you really understand women?

04:18.120 --> 04:22.320
Some women stand out
because of their bravery,

04:23.680 --> 04:26.800
some shine brightly
because of their kindness,

04:26.880 --> 04:30.320
and others dazzle because of their wisdom.

04:31.520 --> 04:34.040
They're beautiful in their own ways,

04:34.120 --> 04:35.440
yet you only

04:39.680 --> 04:41.840
want to define beauty by appearance.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.840
You believe

04:43.920 --> 04:47.160
a woman can only be confident
when she looks pretty.

04:47.760 --> 04:48.920
Since you're so narrow-minded,

04:49.880 --> 04:53.440
your products can't be better.

05:01.200 --> 05:02.040
Wait.

05:07.200 --> 05:08.040
What?

05:10.200 --> 05:12.320
So arrogant. It was nonsense.

05:12.960 --> 05:14.040
Never mind.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.440
Let's hire a star.

05:15.520 --> 05:16.440
No.

05:18.840 --> 05:20.280
She's the best model.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.080
I was so blind

05:23.160 --> 05:25.080
that I fell for that stupid Tang Qi.

05:25.160 --> 05:27.280
This is his brain.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.360
Taste it.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.400
It's good!

05:32.480 --> 05:34.640
This is his body.

05:37.280 --> 05:38.120
So good!

05:38.200 --> 05:39.920
No matter what,

05:40.000 --> 05:41.400
you turned him down in public today.

05:41.480 --> 05:43.160
It was worth it.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.680
From now on, just avoid him

05:45.760 --> 05:46.720
as if he's a road barrier.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.200
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

06:02.640 --> 06:04.040
TANG QI

06:08.440 --> 06:10.040
TANG QI

06:10.120 --> 06:11.960
BLOCK THIS CALLER

06:13.440 --> 06:14.800
Come on.

06:14.880 --> 06:16.440
Taste his black tripe.

06:20.080 --> 06:21.320
So soft.

06:24.120 --> 06:25.000
Sorry,

06:25.080 --> 06:28.320
the subscriber you dialed
cannot be connected for the moment…

06:28.880 --> 06:32.440
Do you still want Su Miao to be the model?

06:34.120 --> 06:34.960
Yes.

06:35.880 --> 06:37.240
What she said was harsh,

06:37.320 --> 06:38.520
but she had a point.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.440
We're so narrow-minded.

06:45.440 --> 06:47.520
I've contacted Zhu Xinxin's agency

06:47.600 --> 06:49.720
to confirm the shooting date and process.

06:49.800 --> 06:50.960
We'll sign a deal soon.

06:53.920 --> 06:56.200
We should re-design the poster

06:56.280 --> 06:58.240
and ask Su Miao to be our model.

07:02.160 --> 07:03.440
You still haven't given up.

07:08.280 --> 07:11.360
If the product launch is delayed
due to the shooting

07:11.440 --> 07:13.480
and harms the company's interest,
who'll be responsible?

07:14.280 --> 07:16.200
- I will.
- How?

07:18.280 --> 07:20.680
Cancel my bonus, dividends,

07:23.960 --> 07:25.080
and equity.

07:25.160 --> 07:26.040
I can give up my equity.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.360
- You…
- Stop.

07:29.960 --> 07:31.040
How about this?

07:31.120 --> 07:34.200
Gu, why don't you postpone
the signing of the contract

07:34.280 --> 07:35.800
and let Tang give it a try?

07:36.720 --> 07:38.120
You have one day.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.240
If you can't solve it,

07:39.320 --> 07:41.360
I'll sign the contract tomorrow.

08:11.360 --> 08:14.280
I didn't lie

08:15.480 --> 08:18.720
I wouldn't lie

08:34.480 --> 08:35.320
Su Miao…

08:39.440 --> 08:40.280
You…

08:44.080 --> 08:45.480
You know Su Miao, right?

08:50.680 --> 08:52.040
Why are you saying this?

08:53.640 --> 08:55.280
You have the same bracelet.

08:56.920 --> 08:58.160
It's a rare kind.

09:03.080 --> 09:05.720
I bought it on Taobao. You're so funny.

09:11.760 --> 09:13.480
This is Su Miao's bag.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.240
If you didn't know each other,

09:15.840 --> 09:17.360
how could we have found you

09:17.440 --> 09:19.160
based on this bag?

09:19.240 --> 09:21.600
And how could she have known
we were looking for her

09:21.680 --> 09:23.200
and suddenly showed up?

09:27.680 --> 09:30.600
Yes. We know each other.

09:31.800 --> 09:33.720
I asked her to go to your company.

09:34.400 --> 09:35.240
Then, please contact her.

09:36.920 --> 09:38.800
I want to talk to her in person.

09:56.280 --> 09:58.040
Hello, Su Miao.

09:59.400 --> 10:00.760
Is Tang Qi with you?

10:00.840 --> 10:02.040
Yes.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.520
I'm already home.

10:05.280 --> 10:06.680
Tang Qi could not be that smart.

10:06.760 --> 10:07.880
Did he suspect that you--?

10:07.960 --> 10:10.720
Mr. Tang from Thousand Birds Collection
knows we are friends,

10:10.800 --> 10:13.320
so he asked me about your free time.

10:13.400 --> 10:14.760
He wants to meet you.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.760
Okay, then.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.640
I'll make it clear and let him give up.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.680
Okay, it's a deal.

10:22.760 --> 10:23.760
See you tonight.

10:23.840 --> 10:24.720
Bye.

10:28.000 --> 10:30.640
She said she'd send you the address.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.600
Okay?

10:32.880 --> 10:34.520
Okay. Thanks.

10:39.920 --> 10:41.000
Ridiculous.

10:49.320 --> 10:52.640
Why did Tang Qi insist on hiring me?

10:55.360 --> 10:58.040
BUTTERFLY

11:09.880 --> 11:11.800
Is it because of this face?

11:15.160 --> 11:16.400
If it weren't for this face,

11:16.920 --> 11:18.760
would it be for your soul?

11:24.720 --> 11:25.840
Scum.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.960
You can use this phone for now.

11:36.040 --> 11:37.400
It has two SIM cards.

11:37.480 --> 11:39.800
I prepared a new number for Su Miao.

11:40.880 --> 11:42.280
Su Miao doesn't even exist.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.840
Why does she need a number?

11:43.920 --> 11:46.360
Now that Tang Qi is interested in Su Miao,

11:46.440 --> 11:49.080
you should use this identity
to make him give up.

11:49.680 --> 11:51.480
Give up?

11:51.560 --> 11:53.480
You've had a crush on him,

11:53.560 --> 11:55.600
so you must know what he likes.

11:56.160 --> 11:57.440
What are you talking about?

11:57.520 --> 11:59.000
I'm just telling the truth.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.920
Please be true to yourself.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.760
Remember the shame and be brave.

12:02.840 --> 12:05.080
I wish I could go back in time

12:05.160 --> 12:06.120
and choke myself.

12:06.200 --> 12:08.800
Go against the grain, okay?

12:08.880 --> 12:10.280
You cannot only get rid of him,

12:10.360 --> 12:11.720
but make him feel sick.

12:11.800 --> 12:14.480
Don't miss any opportunity
to seek revenge.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.320
You have a point.

13:17.240 --> 13:20.480
Tang Qi is sensitive
to fluorescent and glittering things.

13:20.560 --> 13:22.400
Don't scare him on purpose.

13:22.480 --> 13:25.440
I didn't mean to! I didn't know!

13:42.080 --> 13:44.960
Seven o'clock, at 178 Yunshan Road.

13:45.040 --> 13:48.200
178 YUNSHAN ROAD

14:06.880 --> 14:08.440
- Ms. Su.
- Have a seat.

14:21.880 --> 14:22.760
Have some drinks.

14:46.280 --> 14:48.760
You'll definitely throw up.

14:54.680 --> 14:55.600
This time,

14:56.520 --> 14:58.040
I asked you out

14:58.120 --> 15:00.040
because I want you

15:00.640 --> 15:02.440
to be our product's model.

15:12.240 --> 15:13.640
I'll finish it first.

15:20.040 --> 15:21.200
Can you see it?

15:21.760 --> 15:22.840
Can you see it?

15:23.720 --> 15:24.720
Is it good?

15:28.440 --> 15:29.520
Ms. Su…

15:31.120 --> 15:32.240
You look good.

15:40.720 --> 15:43.560
He doesn't hate fluorescent

15:43.640 --> 15:45.320
and glittering things anymore?

15:52.400 --> 15:53.240
Come on.

15:54.280 --> 15:55.440
I've ordered dishes.

15:55.520 --> 15:56.640
Beef tendon and intestines,

15:57.160 --> 15:59.240
haggis, lamb kidney,

15:59.920 --> 16:01.120
lamb tripe,

16:01.200 --> 16:02.560
and beef tripe.

16:10.160 --> 16:12.200
Let's eat outside school.

16:12.280 --> 16:14.080
There's a new lamb intestines
rice noodle shop.

16:14.840 --> 16:17.040
I don't eat intestines.
It makes me feel sick.

16:38.040 --> 16:39.640
Did you buy lamb intestines?

16:40.520 --> 16:42.720
I heard that senior muttering about

16:42.800 --> 16:43.960
how Tang Qi hates intestines.

16:44.640 --> 16:46.120
Does he hate intestines?

17:46.600 --> 17:47.720
Why are there so many flies?

17:48.720 --> 17:50.880
Maybe we should go… somewhere else.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.520
Indeed.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.600
I've always been like this.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.040
Other people attract butterflies,

17:59.120 --> 18:01.440
but I attract mosquitoes and flies

18:01.520 --> 18:04.400
wherever I go.

18:15.400 --> 18:17.240
I didn't know you faced

18:18.280 --> 18:19.720
so many difficulties when you grew up.

18:24.480 --> 18:25.520
No wonder you're so brave,

18:26.440 --> 18:27.280
confident,

18:28.480 --> 18:29.400
and beautiful.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.240
You're having allergies.

19:03.160 --> 19:04.720
I'll buy some medicine for you.

19:07.680 --> 19:10.000
Look at me carefully.

19:10.080 --> 19:12.440
Do you still think I'm brave,
confident, and beautiful?

19:17.280 --> 19:18.520
For most ladies,

19:19.160 --> 19:20.720
if they're having allergies like this,

19:21.320 --> 19:22.840
they wouldn't even go out.

19:25.280 --> 19:27.080
However, you're just being yourself,

19:27.680 --> 19:29.480
without caring what others think.

19:29.560 --> 19:34.200
You're indeed brave,
confident, and beautiful.

19:40.840 --> 19:44.600
HAIYUE TANG MANSION

19:47.520 --> 19:49.160
I wonder how it is going.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.680
Chengcheng must've taken revenge.

20:00.600 --> 20:02.160
Poor thing.

20:08.960 --> 20:11.080
Did you leave home?

20:11.160 --> 20:12.280
Where's your master?

20:21.120 --> 20:23.320
Is this your turtle?

20:28.040 --> 20:30.040
It's so rare.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.840
I've never seen it approach

20:34.600 --> 20:37.840
someone else before.

20:38.440 --> 20:40.920
You're destined to meet each other.

20:41.000 --> 20:42.960
Approach me?

20:44.800 --> 20:46.360
It's a lucky turtle

20:46.440 --> 20:48.440
that comes from the Changbai Mountains

20:48.520 --> 20:51.120
and was raised by Master Taoguang.

20:51.200 --> 20:53.760
It can bring good luck.

20:53.840 --> 20:56.280
It recognized you as its master,

20:56.360 --> 20:58.600
so why don't you take it back

20:58.680 --> 20:59.920
and fulfill its wish?

21:00.760 --> 21:02.240
- How much?
- Six hundred yuan.

21:06.520 --> 21:07.680
Miss,

21:08.480 --> 21:10.680
it sees you as its master,

21:10.760 --> 21:13.000
and I shouldn't cut off this connection.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.480
How about this?

21:15.960 --> 21:17.920
You only need to pay 200 yuan.

21:22.240 --> 21:24.760
Fate brought you two together.

21:25.400 --> 21:27.160
As long as you raise it properly,

21:27.240 --> 21:30.240
I'm sure you'll have a promising career.

21:30.320 --> 21:32.080
You'll make a fortune, meet handsome guys,

21:32.680 --> 21:35.200
- and overcome all difficulties.
- I'll take it.

21:37.280 --> 21:38.480
God bless you.

21:38.560 --> 21:39.800
Come on.

21:41.520 --> 21:42.440
Scan this code.

21:43.600 --> 21:44.640
200 CHINESE YUAN

21:47.720 --> 21:48.800
Miss!

21:51.120 --> 21:52.160
This is for you.

21:53.520 --> 21:54.760
For me?

21:55.840 --> 21:57.720
- Thanks.
- Put it in.

21:57.800 --> 21:58.760
Raise it properly.

21:59.360 --> 22:03.800
I wish you success and happiness.

22:08.760 --> 22:09.600
Okay.

22:10.320 --> 22:11.240
The price stays the same,

22:11.320 --> 22:13.080
but we'll shoot for an extra hour.

22:14.920 --> 22:17.040
Okay, that's it.

22:41.200 --> 22:42.040
Sir!

22:42.120 --> 22:43.320
Sir!

22:46.200 --> 22:47.920
This turtle is mine.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.680
Hey, look…

23:01.040 --> 23:02.120
Sir, it…

23:02.200 --> 23:03.520
Didn't I give it back?

23:05.800 --> 23:08.360
It recognized you as its master,

23:08.440 --> 23:09.640
which means you're meant

23:10.320 --> 23:11.920
to meet each other.

23:16.520 --> 23:19.640
You sprinkled the ground
with its favorite shrimp powder.

23:19.720 --> 23:22.320
It only costs a few cents,
and you're saying it's fate?

23:24.080 --> 23:25.280
Well…

23:27.040 --> 23:28.040
It…

23:29.520 --> 23:32.800
It's a lucky turtle that comes
from the Changbai Mountains

23:32.880 --> 23:34.920
and was raised by Master Taoguang.

23:35.000 --> 23:37.600
It can bring good luck.

23:37.680 --> 23:39.160
It's worth 600 yuan.

23:39.800 --> 23:41.800
Now that you don't believe in fate,

23:41.880 --> 23:43.800
I'll offer you the best price, 200 yuan.

23:43.880 --> 23:45.000
A red-eared turtle

23:46.080 --> 23:48.560
is only worth five yuan at most.

23:49.280 --> 23:51.720
You tortured it so much

23:51.800 --> 23:53.480
that it's not even worth

23:53.560 --> 23:55.400
three yuan in the market.

23:56.040 --> 23:58.240
Well, bro, what you said

23:58.320 --> 23:59.800
is right.

24:01.360 --> 24:02.640
Did you raise a turtle before?

24:02.720 --> 24:03.960
No.

24:04.720 --> 24:06.280
But I have a brain.

24:08.040 --> 24:08.880
Fine.

24:08.960 --> 24:11.640
I'll stop embarrassing myself.

24:12.560 --> 24:13.600
Bye.

24:25.240 --> 24:26.400
I need a box.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.800
It's more comfortable for the turtle.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.040
Sure.

24:42.800 --> 24:44.320
Here, sir.

24:47.040 --> 24:49.800
You make deals with your ability,

24:49.880 --> 24:52.320
but it's wrong to abandon
the ship when you dock.

24:54.320 --> 24:55.840
You count on them to do business,

24:55.920 --> 24:57.040
so be good to them.

24:57.120 --> 24:58.120
Don't torture them.

24:58.800 --> 25:01.160
Yes. I made a mistake.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.000
Goodbye.

25:10.680 --> 25:13.960
Wish you success and happiness.

25:16.160 --> 25:17.640
That scum Tang Qi

25:17.720 --> 25:19.680
is so superficial.

25:19.760 --> 25:21.400
He thinks Su Miao is cute

25:21.480 --> 25:23.040
only because she has a pretty face.

25:23.120 --> 25:25.240
He said so many sweet words.

25:25.320 --> 25:27.880
Don't tell me you agreed to be the model.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.720
Of course not.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.600
But he said

25:32.680 --> 25:35.120
he'd make me change my mind.

25:35.200 --> 25:37.160
Will I change because of him?

25:37.240 --> 25:38.320
So ridiculous.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.440
Well done.

25:40.520 --> 25:43.000
Should I go
to Thousand Birds Collection tomorrow?

25:43.080 --> 25:44.280
Why not?

25:44.880 --> 25:46.560
Your sister got the job for you.

25:46.640 --> 25:48.520
How can you give up for a man?

25:48.600 --> 25:50.680
Which is more important, men or work?

25:50.760 --> 25:52.240
Work.

25:52.320 --> 25:54.920
Rest well. Tomorrow is a brand new day.

25:55.880 --> 25:56.720
Bye.

26:15.400 --> 26:17.400
COSMETICS TRIAL PACK

26:40.000 --> 26:40.840
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

27:02.760 --> 27:04.640
- This seat is available. Just sit here.
- Okay.

27:09.040 --> 27:10.320
Hello.

27:16.840 --> 27:17.960
Have you heard?

27:18.040 --> 27:19.600
Mr. Tang still hasn't persuaded Su Miao,

27:19.680 --> 27:21.240
that amateur model.

27:21.320 --> 27:23.200
Will the company apply
Mr. Gu's plan instead?

27:23.280 --> 27:24.320
No.

27:24.400 --> 27:26.240
Mr. Tang insists on using her.

27:26.320 --> 27:28.040
The product launch is near.

27:28.120 --> 27:29.120
If we keep waiting,

27:29.200 --> 27:31.360
the promotion plan might be canceled.

27:31.440 --> 27:33.600
Will our year-end bonuses be canceled too?

27:33.680 --> 27:35.120
I want to buy a car.

27:35.200 --> 27:36.600
Bonus is not a big deal.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.640
We might even lose our jobs.

27:38.720 --> 27:40.400
I just got married,

27:40.480 --> 27:42.360
and I need to pay the mortgage.

27:44.120 --> 27:45.520
Is the company really in trouble?

27:45.600 --> 27:48.000
Enough. Stop scaring yourself.

27:48.080 --> 27:49.920
You'll only make it worse.

27:54.320 --> 27:55.360
Come on.

27:56.040 --> 27:57.680
Here's the info about
our previous products.

27:57.760 --> 27:58.600
Please get familiar with them.

27:59.200 --> 28:01.520
All our work is based on the products.

28:01.600 --> 28:04.240
Okay. Is the poster really important?

28:04.320 --> 28:05.480
Of course.

28:05.560 --> 28:07.920
We have very limited channels
for offline sales.

28:08.520 --> 28:11.200
And our new product
will mainly be sold online,

28:11.280 --> 28:13.480
so the promotional poster
is very important.

28:13.560 --> 28:14.400
Okay, I got it.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.360
COSMETICS TRIAL PACK

28:26.920 --> 28:28.480
LIPSTICK

28:35.680 --> 28:38.560
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

28:39.320 --> 28:42.880
It turns out the book's owner
works at Thousand Birds Collection.

28:54.680 --> 28:57.640
Why did Su Miao refuse to work for us?

28:57.720 --> 28:58.840
How should I know?

28:58.920 --> 29:00.760
No matter who the model is,

29:01.360 --> 29:02.600
I can't lose this job.

29:04.440 --> 29:07.200
The owner finally found a job

29:07.280 --> 29:08.720
and wouldn't want to lose it.

29:13.680 --> 29:15.800
We'll have a meeting in ten minutes.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.120
Wang Yi, copy this.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.040
Okay.

29:20.360 --> 29:22.640
Skin has different colors,

29:22.720 --> 29:25.720
including light, deep,

29:25.800 --> 29:28.320
cold, warm, pure,

29:28.400 --> 29:29.800
and soft colors.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.720
Therefore,

29:31.800 --> 29:33.040
we should use different cosmetics.

29:33.120 --> 29:33.960
DIFFERENT SKIN COLORS

29:34.040 --> 29:36.320
To present our products,

29:36.400 --> 29:38.320
we should use ordinary people
with different skin colors

29:38.400 --> 29:40.200
for the poster.

29:40.280 --> 29:42.400
They don't need perfect shapes or faces

29:42.480 --> 29:43.920
because we want to show

29:44.000 --> 29:46.040
the beauty of ordinary people.

29:46.640 --> 29:48.720
- Ordinary people?
- How's that possible?

29:48.800 --> 29:50.400
Which means

29:50.480 --> 29:53.840
we need at least five more amateur models.

29:54.680 --> 29:55.600
I disagree.

29:58.640 --> 29:59.520
Why?

30:00.120 --> 30:01.320
You can't even handle Su Miao,

30:02.040 --> 30:03.560
and now you want more ordinary people.

30:03.640 --> 30:04.600
It's impossible.

30:05.200 --> 30:07.760
I've discussed all the details
with Zhu Xinxin's agency.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.520
We can sign it immediately.

30:21.320 --> 30:23.640
Tang Qi's plan is bold,

30:23.720 --> 30:26.320
but it can meet the needs
of ordinary people.

30:27.040 --> 30:29.880
It seems he really listened to Su Miao.

30:33.920 --> 30:35.320
I knew it.

30:35.400 --> 30:37.040
Whenever Mr. Gu disagrees with Mr. Tang,

30:37.120 --> 30:39.760
no matter how harsh he is,
he'll compromise in the end.

30:39.840 --> 30:40.760
That's right.

30:40.840 --> 30:42.480
They agreed to sign it today,

30:43.080 --> 30:44.600
but they changed the date again.

30:44.680 --> 30:45.520
Stop talking.

30:45.600 --> 30:47.200
Let's find more amateur models.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.640
ER GUAN

30:53.600 --> 30:54.760
Sorry,

30:54.840 --> 30:57.440
the subscriber you dialed
cannot be connected for the moment.

30:57.520 --> 30:58.440
Please dial again later.

31:01.480 --> 31:03.000
ER GUAN

31:03.080 --> 31:04.040
So annoying.

31:12.840 --> 31:14.560
ER GUAN

31:24.040 --> 31:25.200
Hello, Ms. Su.

31:25.280 --> 31:28.080
Based on your criticism,

31:28.160 --> 31:30.120
we prepared a new shooting plan.

31:30.640 --> 31:32.160
Where are you? Are you available?

31:32.240 --> 31:35.120
I want to talk to you in person.

31:39.920 --> 31:42.280
Hello? Hello, Ms. Su?

31:45.400 --> 31:47.160
If Su Chengcheng agrees,

31:47.240 --> 31:49.360
- I'll agree.
- What?

31:49.440 --> 31:52.280
Mr. Tang, you made a mistake,

31:52.360 --> 31:53.920
but your company is innocent.

31:54.000 --> 31:57.400
I'm sure she wouldn't want
her colleagues to suffer.

31:57.480 --> 32:01.080
So, if she agrees, I'll agree.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.520
Where is Su Chengcheng?

32:20.560 --> 32:21.480
No idea.

32:22.920 --> 32:24.160
Maybe in the restroom.

32:24.800 --> 32:26.320
She's not in the restroom.

32:26.400 --> 32:28.800
I saw her playing
with her phone on the balcony.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.120
Xu Yue.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.400
What?

32:38.480 --> 32:40.080
I'm telling the truth.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.400
She slacks off on her first day.

32:41.480 --> 32:43.200
The boss should know.

32:54.920 --> 32:56.080
Where were you?

32:57.840 --> 32:59.160
In the restroom.

33:01.640 --> 33:03.320
- Su Miao said--
- I know.

33:03.400 --> 33:05.360
She just told me

33:05.440 --> 33:06.800
if I agree,

33:06.880 --> 33:08.520
she'll be the model.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.640
It's important to the company.

33:13.720 --> 33:17.360
No matter what you want, as long
as it's reasonable, I can accept it.

33:21.040 --> 33:24.640
I don't want anything from the company.

33:24.720 --> 33:27.320
But you need to do something.

33:43.080 --> 33:44.920
EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
ALUMNI ASSOCIATION

33:54.360 --> 33:56.000
What is happening?

33:56.080 --> 34:02.240
EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
ALUMNI ASSOCIATION

34:08.560 --> 34:10.280
Dear Ms. Su Chengcheng,

34:10.360 --> 34:12.199
at the alumni meeting,

34:13.159 --> 34:14.360
I said you were ugly.

34:15.480 --> 34:17.000
I was so rude.

34:18.199 --> 34:19.679
Now, I'm apologizing to you.

34:20.920 --> 34:21.880
Please forgive me.

34:23.800 --> 34:26.239
I can't believe it!

34:30.080 --> 34:31.639
- Hello.
- Chengcheng,

34:31.719 --> 34:33.719
why did he suddenly apologize?

34:36.880 --> 34:38.600
I agreed to be the model.

34:38.679 --> 34:39.520
What?

34:39.600 --> 34:40.800
Are you crazy?

34:40.880 --> 34:43.320
Don't you know Su Miao doesn't exist?

34:43.400 --> 34:44.920
Do you want to be
an official employee or not?

34:46.199 --> 34:47.199
I'll…

34:49.320 --> 34:50.600
I'll take a day off.

34:51.840 --> 34:53.719
Just one day. It doesn't matter.

34:54.320 --> 34:56.040
As long as I work hard,

34:56.120 --> 34:57.480
the boss will notice me.

34:58.160 --> 34:59.280
For the shooting tomorrow,

34:59.360 --> 35:00.600
- we hired more models.
- Bye.

35:00.680 --> 35:02.360
So, we have a lot of work to do.

35:02.440 --> 35:04.160
No one can take leave.

35:04.920 --> 35:06.480
What if I have to?

35:07.360 --> 35:08.480
Please submit your resignation.

35:22.160 --> 35:23.560
Relax.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.760
More relaxed.

35:27.480 --> 35:29.200
More confident. Come on.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.960
She doesn't look good.

35:47.040 --> 35:48.760
She's too nervous.
The photos can't be good.

35:49.520 --> 35:51.440
Give her some time. Let's try again.

36:03.120 --> 36:04.080
Okay.

36:05.320 --> 36:06.200
Look at the camera.

36:08.160 --> 36:09.240
Come on. Smile.

36:11.680 --> 36:12.920
Okay.

36:13.000 --> 36:14.320
Another one.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.880
Be confident.

36:17.960 --> 36:18.880
Another one.

36:22.760 --> 36:23.880
Alright.

36:48.320 --> 36:49.640
That's what I'm talking about.

37:19.000 --> 37:21.040
Why did he dress up like this?

37:25.920 --> 37:27.160
Maybe Su Miao likes it.

37:27.240 --> 37:29.360
Great. Excellent. Keep doing that.

37:32.760 --> 37:34.280
Do you think Tang made the right choice?

37:36.360 --> 37:37.200
Not bad.

37:39.200 --> 37:40.840
Great, fantastic.

37:44.000 --> 37:44.960
Come on.

37:46.680 --> 37:47.520
Let's take a break.

37:48.280 --> 37:49.920
It's too normal right now

37:50.000 --> 37:51.880
to showcase the features.

37:56.480 --> 37:57.960
What features?

37:58.560 --> 38:01.680
Apart from the glittering effect,
its biggest feature is that

38:01.760 --> 38:03.400
it can last for a long time

38:04.240 --> 38:05.560
and is water-proof.

38:06.400 --> 38:08.440
The user will not feel embarrassed

38:08.520 --> 38:10.680
in any circumstances.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.960
I have an idea.

38:51.040 --> 38:51.960
Perfect.

38:52.640 --> 38:53.560
Look at the camera.

38:54.960 --> 38:55.800
That's right.

39:34.320 --> 39:35.840
Over here.

40:10.120 --> 40:11.240
Fantastic.

40:17.800 --> 40:18.880
Good choice.

40:26.960 --> 40:30.640
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

40:35.760 --> 40:36.600
Thanks.

40:38.440 --> 40:39.280
Why are you alone?

40:41.840 --> 40:43.240
According to the plan,

40:43.320 --> 40:45.920
Su Chengcheng was supposed
to assist me with costumes and props,

40:46.000 --> 40:50.000
but this morning, she asked me for a favor

40:50.600 --> 40:51.680
and went missing.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.640
She didn't answer my calls.

40:57.880 --> 40:58.920
These ones look good.

41:01.400 --> 41:02.680
Thanks.

41:02.760 --> 41:04.440
You can take a break and come back later.

41:13.200 --> 41:14.040
ER GUAN

41:29.160 --> 41:30.520
- Hello.
- Where are you?

41:30.600 --> 41:32.360
Why aren't you preparing the props?

41:32.440 --> 41:33.360
I…

41:37.360 --> 41:40.200
Su Miao asked me to get her clothes.

41:40.280 --> 41:41.360
Come back.

41:41.440 --> 41:42.600
Wang Yi can't handle it alone.

41:42.680 --> 41:45.480
I got it. I'm coming.

41:49.040 --> 41:50.000
Thanks.

42:08.120 --> 42:09.800
Here are the clothes
and underwear you wanted.

42:09.880 --> 42:11.920
- How did you get them wet?
- Thanks. Talk to you later.

42:12.000 --> 42:13.360
I'll treat you to a big meal. Bye.

42:13.960 --> 42:15.120
I've never seen someone like this.

42:15.200 --> 42:17.280
You fell for your own trap!

42:17.360 --> 42:18.280
Remember to change it!

42:27.520 --> 42:28.640
Let me do it.

42:29.840 --> 42:30.840
No need.

42:33.080 --> 42:33.920
Sorry.

42:34.000 --> 42:35.920
I didn't feel well.

42:36.000 --> 42:37.480
You must be tired.

42:39.200 --> 42:41.800
I bought cakes and coffee.

42:42.320 --> 42:43.640
I'll leave them here.

42:45.080 --> 42:46.760
Is there anything I can do?

42:48.880 --> 42:50.440
It's almost done.

42:57.600 --> 42:58.760
Here.

43:05.320 --> 43:07.400
It's the trending coffee.

43:07.480 --> 43:08.320
Take one.

43:08.400 --> 43:10.080
If you like it, you can take another cup.

43:10.160 --> 43:12.720
- I bought a lot.
- I… Mr. Tang.

43:19.160 --> 43:20.280
Did you buy the coffee?

43:20.360 --> 43:21.280
Who else

43:22.680 --> 43:23.640
could it be?

43:26.760 --> 43:28.640
No need. Thanks.

43:29.880 --> 43:31.160
- Is the light ready?
- Yes.

43:31.760 --> 43:33.040
Let's keep working.

43:35.720 --> 43:36.720
Where are you going?

43:37.840 --> 43:38.720
Where's Su Miao?

43:57.320 --> 43:58.320
You need

43:59.240 --> 44:00.760
to pay attention to the props
during the shooting.

44:01.520 --> 44:02.680
You can't leave.

44:04.200 --> 44:06.080
Does anyone know where Su Miao is?

44:10.800 --> 44:12.320
Oh no! I need to go to the restroom!

44:12.400 --> 44:13.440
I can't hold it!

44:13.520 --> 44:14.680
Oh no!

44:32.840 --> 44:35.400
Hello. I'm in the restroom.

44:35.480 --> 44:36.680
I'm coming.

44:46.960 --> 44:48.040
Okay, lights on.

44:48.120 --> 44:49.480
Let's keep shooting.

44:49.560 --> 44:51.800
You need to get closer, okay?

44:51.880 --> 44:54.080
Very good.

44:54.160 --> 44:55.160
Closer, please.

44:55.240 --> 44:56.160
That's right.

45:12.920 --> 45:13.960
VACANT, OCCUPIED

45:26.000 --> 45:27.160
VACANT, OCCUPIED

45:40.480 --> 45:42.040
VACANT, OCCUPIED
